## Security & Compliance

### Secrets Management
```env
VAULT_ADDR=http://localhost:8200
VAULT_TOKEN=...
```

### Rate Limiting
```env
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX_REQUESTS=1000
```

### CORS
```env
CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:3002,http://localhost:3000
```

